# Data Privacy & Compliance (NDPR / GDPR)

- NEVER collect location data beyond country and city from IP geolocation
- NEVER collect GPS or precise real-time location — illegal without explicit consent
- ALWAYS check user consent before logging activity data
- ALWAYS provide data in structured format when user requests export
- ALWAYS permanently delete ALL user data when account deletion is requested
- NEVER retain personal data beyond the defined retention period (2 years inactive)
- ALWAYS log consent: who gave it, when, what version of policy, from which IP
- NEVER share user data with third parties without explicit consent
- ALWAYS anonymize data used for analytics where possible
